{"id":"2772d51949360c14","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-lachlan-game.md","title":"Lachlan 枚举博弈的阶段签名","display":"df-lachlan-game — Lachlan 枚举博弈的阶段签名","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-lachlan-game","aliases":["20-df-lachlan-game"],"display":"df-lachlan-game — Lachlan 枚举博弈的阶段签名","chapter":"2","section":"2.5","source_kind":"local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 2.5.1；§16.2 的本地阶段展开","source_pdf_pages":[79,80],"source_printed_pages":[43,44],"depends_on":["[[20-df-finite-code]]","[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-formula]]","[[20-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-lachlan-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-lachlan-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lachlan-game — Lachlan 枚举博弈的阶段签名"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 2.5.1；§16.2 的本地阶段展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>79</span><span>80</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43</span><span>44</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9885f96cf9cb2fff\" href=\"?note=9885f96cf9cb2fff\" title=\"20-df-finite-sequence-code\">20-df-finite-sequence-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d4a7833057f5a20e\" href=\"?note=d4a7833057f5a20e\" title=\"20-df-satisfaction\">20-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=\\{u\\subseteq\\omega^2:|u|&lt;\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathcal F=\\{u\\subseteq\\omega^2:|u|&lt;\\omega\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal F^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal F^\\omega\\)</span> 指定允许的红方走法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 为蓝方全策略函数。固定可计算语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{RB}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{RB}\\)</span>，含算术符号及两个二元关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot R,\\dot B\">\\(\\dot R,\\dot B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\rho_e)\">\\((\\rho_e)\\)</span> 为有效给出的该语言的句子列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_{R,B}\">\\(\\mathfrak N_{R,B}\\)</span> 是以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 为载体、算术符号通常解释、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot R,\\dot B\">\\(\\dot R,\\dot B\\)</span> 分别解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,B\">\\(R,B\\)</span> 的结构。游戏参数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(\\mathcal P,(\\rho_e))\">\\(G=(\\mathcal P,(\\rho_e))\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9885f96cf9cb2fff\" href=\"?note=9885f96cf9cb2fff\" title=\"20-df-finite-sequence-code\">20-df-finite-sequence-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d4a7833057f5a20e\" href=\"?note=d4a7833057f5a20e\" title=\"20-df-satisfaction\">20-df-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lachlan-game}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{mcode}(u):=\\operatorname{fcode}(\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:(n,x)\\in u\\}),\\quad\n\\operatorname{mdecode}(d):=\\{(\\pi_1(z),\\pi_2(z)):z\\in D_d\\},\\\\\nb_s^f(r):=\\operatorname{mdecode}\\!\\left(f\\!\\left(\\operatorname{seqcode}\n(\\operatorname{mcode}(r_0),\\operatorname{mcode}(b_0^f(r)),\\ldots,\n\\operatorname{mcode}(r_{s-1}),\\operatorname{mcode}(b_{s-1}^f(r)),\\operatorname{mcode}(r_s))\\right)\\right),\\\\\nR(r):=\\bigcup_s r_s,\\quad B(b):=\\bigcup_s b_s,\\quad\nU_n^r:=\\{x:(n,x)\\in R(r)\\},\\quad V_n^b:=\\{x:(n,x)\\in B(b)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall e\\ \\mathfrak N_{R(r),B(b)}\\models\\rho_e,\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinningBlue}_G(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal P\\ \\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b^f(r)).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lachlan-game}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{mcode}(u):=\\operatorname{fcode}(\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:(n,x)\\in u\\}),\\quad\n\\operatorname{mdecode}(d):=\\{(\\pi_1(z),\\pi_2(z)):z\\in D_d\\},\\\\\nb_s^f(r):=\\operatorname{mdecode}\\!\\left(f\\!\\left(\\operatorname{seqcode}\n(\\operatorname{mcode}(r_0),\\operatorname{mcode}(b_0^f(r)),\\ldots,\n\\operatorname{mcode}(r_{s-1}),\\operatorname{mcode}(b_{s-1}^f(r)),\\operatorname{mcode}(r_s))\\right)\\right),\\\\\nR(r):=\\bigcup_s r_s,\\quad B(b):=\\bigcup_s b_s,\\quad\nU_n^r:=\\{x:(n,x)\\in R(r)\\},\\quad V_n^b:=\\{x:(n,x)\\in B(b)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall e\\ \\mathfrak N_{R(r),B(b)}\\models\\rho_e,\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinningBlue}_G(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal P\\ \\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b^f(r)).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=0\">\\(s=0\\)</span> 的历史只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_0\">\\(r_0\\)</span>。蓝方反应按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 的有限递归定义，只读取此前蓝方走法和当前红方走法；全函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 总给一个有限走法码。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 时可省略谓词下标；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{f,r}\">\\(A^{f,r}\\)</span> 表示该对局最终第 0 蓝列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_0^{b^f(r)}\">\\(V_0^{b^f(r)}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>每阶段 RED 先走，BLUE 再响应；最终列只增长。句子通过上游满足关系解释，历史通过明确的可逆编码传给策略，不再调用未定义的 code(r₀,b₀,…,rₛ)。普通可计算策略与普通可计算红方走法产生 c.e. 蓝列；非有效红方对局的最终列只保证是集合。相对 oracle 的版本须同时相对化两方的有效性。此处对第一阶可表达需求给本地阶段接口；不声称原书任意游戏需求都已经转换成句子码。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 2.5.1；印刷 43–44 / PDF 79–80；§16.2 的编码解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"9885f96cf9cb2fff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"d4a7833057f5a20e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"9885f96cf9cb2fff","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"d4a7833057f5a20e","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F=\\{u\\subseteq\\omega^2:|u|<\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal F^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{RB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot R,\\dot B","display":false},{"tex":"(\\rho_e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_{R,B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot R,\\dot B","display":false},{"tex":"R,B","display":false},{"tex":"G=(\\mathcal P,(\\rho_e))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lachlan-game}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{mcode}(u):=\\operatorname{fcode}(\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:(n,x)\\in u\\}),\\quad\n\\operatorname{mdecode}(d):=\\{(\\pi_1(z),\\pi_2(z)):z\\in D_d\\},\\\\\nb_s^f(r):=\\operatorname{mdecode}\\!\\left(f\\!\\left(\\operatorname{seqcode}\n(\\operatorname{mcode}(r_0),\\operatorname{mcode}(b_0^f(r)),\\ldots,\n\\operatorname{mcode}(r_{s-1}),\\operatorname{mcode}(b_{s-1}^f(r)),\\operatorname{mcode}(r_s))\\right)\\right),\\\\\nR(r):=\\bigcup_s r_s,\\quad B(b):=\\bigcup_s b_s,\\quad\nU_n^r:=\\{x:(n,x)\\in R(r)\\},\\quad V_n^b:=\\{x:(n,x)\\in B(b)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall e\\ \\mathfrak N_{R(r),B(b)}\\models\\rho_e,\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinningBlue}_G(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\in\\mathcal P\\ \\operatorname{WinBlue}_G(r,b^f(r)).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"s=0","display":false},{"tex":"r_0","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"A^{f,r}","display":false},{"tex":"V_0^{b^f(r)}","display":false}],"bytes":3083,"backlinks":[{"id":"711da376393d5bc5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-lachlan-game]]；see [[20-df-functional-graph]]；see [[20-thm-graph]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"0ec3e4391cca9764","anchor":"ref-5","location